f74607ce-105e-4f0b-8f88-82776ef5a664	Jons Civil Engineering Company Limited	IRL	\N	{"text": "Ireland – Construction work – Cork City Council is seeking a qualified works contractor for Glanmire Roads Improvement Scheme Contract 2 Sustainable transport improvement works to the L2998 Dunkettle Road, R639 / L3010 junction, East Cliff Road, Aldi Link Road and Hazelwood Road. The works will require a new section of new road connecting the East Cliff Road / L3010 junction with the existing road constructed as part of the Aldi development. The works include, but not limited to, signalised junctions, pedestrian crossings, retaining walls, a ramp to John O'Callaghan Park and the provision of new footpaths, cycleways, accommodation works, utility works, public lighting, traffic signs and road markings and other ancillary works. Ireland – Road construction works – N53 Hackballscross to Rassan Scheme – Contractor Services The proposed scheme entitled “N53 Hackballscross to Rassan” will commence at an appropriate tie-in point adjacent to Hackballscross in the Townland of Carrickastuck in Co. Louth and traverse west through the town lands of Annaghvacky, Shanmullagh and Rassan to tie-in to the existing engineered road cross section point in the Townland of Rassan. The scheme consists of the realignment of circa 3.34km of the existing N53 National Secondary Route.", "regions": ["IRL"], "cpv_codes": ["45000000", "45233120"], "nuts_codes": ["IE053", "IE062"], "award_count": 2, "deal_size_eur": {"max": 12840912.39, "min": 5515727.39, "median": 9178319.89}}	\N	[-0.01827041,-0.029826049,0.023143273,0.063038714,-0.056696147,0.042338632,-0.04401014,-0.105512574,-0.12193319,0.008425094,-0.10921667,-0.023866901,-0.05572031,-0.016126843,-0.12216494,0.06448307,-0.042227585,0.045954693,0.056792844,0.016036974,-0.055732418,0.056493923,-0.026387531,0.023290506,0.0177303,-0.009877333,0.05661796,-0.011875724,0.03859311,-0.05882435,-0.0349924,-0.049051832,-0.057846796,0.10854305,0.068342164,0.0539