6098d8da-79bc-4283-ad7d-667bbe2e1456	90750b66-73c0-4dc6-8e8f-325d5e97ebdb	EU Public Tender: IT Services for RKI's Laboratory & Genomic Data Infrastructure – Potential Fit for Bredex GmbH	Dear Bredex GmbH team,\n\nI wanted to bring a current EU public-sector tender to your attention that may align with your work in IT services and software support.\n\nThe Robert Koch-Institut (RKI) in Germany has published tender 408011-2026, covering the sustainable further development and operational support of laboratory, pathogen, and genomic data infrastructure. The notice falls under CPV 72000000 (IT services: consulting, software development, internet and support) — the same category under which Bredex GmbH has previously been awarded a contract, specifically for maintenance of a knowledge database for a German public authority.\n\nKey details:\n- Buyer: Robert Koch-Institut, Beschaffung (DEU)\n- Scope: IT consulting, software development, and operational support\n- Submission deadline: 15 June 2026\n- No published budget at this time\n\nGiven your documented experience delivering IT support services to German public-sector clients, this tender may warrant a closer look.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to discuss whether this opportunity fits your current priorities?\n\nBest regards	{"tender": {"id": 286, "title": "Germany – IT services: consulting, software development, Internet and support – Rahmenvertrages Nachhaltige Rahmenvertrages Nachhaltige Weiterentwicklung und Betriebsunterstützung im Bereich der Labor-, Erreger- und Genomdateninfrastruktur t", "deadline": "2026-06-15T02:00:00+00:00", "cpv_codes": ["72000000"], "budget_eur": null, "buyer_name": "Robert Koch-Institut, Beschaffung", "buyer_country": "DEU", "ted_notice_id": "408011-2026"}, "company": {"id": "49c83f0a-99f6-4975-8386-be102394a00d", "name": "Bredex GmbH", "country": "DEU", "website": null, "capabilities": {"text": "Germany – IT services: consulting, software development, Internet and support – Support