83213282-cb9b-462a-9d88-b131d0c53fac	169ede10-008e-4e28-879f-1883aa77ef88	EU Public Tender – HVAC Installation, Theodor-Litt-Schule Gießen (TED 427014-2026)	Dear Sauter Cumulus GmbH team,\n\nI wanted to bring a recently published EU public tender to your attention that appears closely aligned with your capabilities.\n\nThe Magistrat der Universitätsstadt Gießen – Hochbauamt – has issued a call for heating, ventilation, and air-conditioning installation work (CPV 45331000) for the new workshop building at Theodor-Litt-Schule, Ringallee 62, 35390 Gießen, Germany.\n\nKey details:\n• TED Notice: 427014-2026\n• Estimated budget: €934,468.48\n• Submission deadline: 22 July 2026\n• Location: Gießen, Germany\n\nGiven that your company operates in Germany and holds prior award experience under the same CPV code (45331000), this tender appears to be a strong procedural fit.\n\nWe would be happy to share the full tender documentation or discuss next steps if you are considering a bid.\n\nBest regards	{"tender": {"id": 2807, "title": "Germany – Heating, ventilation and air-conditioning installation work – Neubau Werkstatt Theodor-Litt-Schule Gießen, Ringallee 62, 35390 Gießen", "deadline": "2026-07-22T02:00:00+00:00", "cpv_codes": ["45331000"], "budget_eur": 934468.48, "buyer_name": "Magistrat der Universitätsstadt Gießen - Hochbauamt -", "buyer_country": "DEU", "ted_notice_id": "427014-2026"}, "company": {"id": "12cb0fef-ee93-4835-a54e-88d34990f007", "name": "Sauter Cumulus GmbH", "country": "DEU", "website": null, "capabilities": {"text": "Germany – Heating, ventilation and air-conditioning installation work – Gebäudeautomation Gebäudeautomation", "regions": ["DEU"], "cpv_codes": ["45331000"], "nuts_codes": ["DE113"], "award_count": 1, "deal_size_eur": {"max": null, "min": null, "median": null}}, "certifications": null}, "match_id": "169ede10-008e-4e28-879f-1883aa77ef88", "draft_generator": "claude", "score_breakdown": {"final_score": 0.9001, "value_score": 0.5, "budget_score